      "title": "File:JESSHEIM Ullensaker, Norway. Gotaasallen Herredshuset (Holger Sinding-Larsen 1901) former municipal building Ringveien Stasjon Railway station streets Bird's-eye view Winter snow etc 2023-02-24 IMG 9379.jpg",
